<title>USA: Estee Lauder Cos Inc Q2 Dec 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Estee Lauder Cos Inc Q2 Dec 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.54		    $0.45</p>
<p> Net			 69,900		   58,500</p>
<p> Revs		     941,500		  860,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 118,900		  116,200</p>
<p>	  6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.93		    $0.81</p>
<p> Net			122,600		  104,900</p>
<p> Revs		   1,814,300		1,693,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 118,700		  115,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for 1995 periods are pro forma because of a recapitalization and issuance of common stock in intial public offering in November 1995. Earnings per share have been computed on a pro forma basis assuming the recapitalization occurred at the beginning of fiscal 1996 and includes the shares issued in the offering and the shares contingently issuable, primarily from stock options.</p>
<p>All earnings figures exclude preferred stock dividends.</p>
<p>First Call consensus estimate for Q2 was $0.52 per share.</p>
</text>
